## Live.cpp/newest
1. all at base: newest is base + 0 s
2. .hidden/d ahead 50 s: newest is base + 0 s
3. .hidden ahead 45 s: newest is base + 0 s
4. b/.e ahead 40 s: newest is base + 0 s
5. b/c ahead 10 s: newest is base + 10 s
6. f ahead 20 s: newest is base + 20 s
7. a ahead 30 s: newest is base + 30 s
8. no such folder: the earliest time there is true
